### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Token do analista
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "analyst",
  "password": "analyst-demo"
}

> {% client.global.set("analystToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Token do administrador
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin-demo"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Forçar envio para a DLT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/fraud-assessments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{analystToken}}

{
  "transactionId": "tx-force-dlt-001",
  "customerId": "customer-dlt",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "deviceId": "device-known",
  "ipAddress": "203.0.113.80",
  "country": "BR",
  "occurredAt": "2026-09-10T12:00:00Z"
}

### Listar eventos da DLT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/dead-letters
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reprocessar evento substituindo o UUID
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/dead-letters/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/replay
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

