### Retrieve decision
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/fraud-assessments/tx-demo-001
Authorization: Bearer {{analystToken}}

### Velocity check
# Envie cinco requisições em menos de um minuto, mudando transactionId para
# tx-velocity-001, 002, 003, 004 e 005. Mantenha customerId, deviceId e
# ipAddress iguais. A quinta requisição ativa FR004, FR005 e FR006.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/fraud-assessments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{analystToken}}

{
  "transactionId": "tx-velocity-001",
  "customerId": "customer-velocity",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "deviceId": "device-velocity",
  "ipAddress": "203.0.113.99",
  "country": "BR",
  "occurredAt": "2026-09-10T12:00:00Z"
}
